# SYNTHETIC. The cancellation path the whole Progress design exists for: a user archives a
# thread while an IDLE is outstanding, the runtime interrupts, and the session winds down in
# protocol so the connection can be reused rather than dropped mid-command.
S: * OK Gimap ready
C: a001 IDLE
S: + idling
INTERRUPT
C: DONE
S: a001 OK IDLE terminated (Success)
DONE
